G04 NOT FOR FABRICATION. halo REPLICA - a reconstruction from photographs.*
G04 1. 0.30 mm at 4 layers is BELOW PCBWay's 0.40 mm four-layer floor and*
G04    JLCPCB's 0.40 mm minimum. AS DRAWN THIS CANNOT BE ORDERED AT EITHER*
G04    HOUSE. The drawing is not moved to suit a process.*
G04 2. The board's own DRC HAS ERRORS. See drc-classification.json:*
G04    they are classified, not cleared, because moving a MEASURED position*
G04    to satisfy a design rule would falsify a measurement.*
G04 3. NO NETLIST BINDING. 65 nets read from the schematic, ZERO pads*
G04    attached. The copper's connectivity is UNKNOWN and every passive*
G04    value is CANNOT DETERMINE.*
G04 4. U1 (nRF52832 WLCSP-50) has NO LAND PATTERN - the ball map is CANNOT*
G04    DETERMINE. U2 (Apple U1 UWB) is UNPOPULATED and has none either.*
G04 5. The outer diameter is a BOUND, 24.95-26.34 mm. The drawn value is*
G04    not a settled diameter, and if it moves it moves DOWN.*
